/-!
# A282150

Numbers n with k digits in base x (MSD(n)=d_k, LSD(n)=d_1) such that, chosen one of their digits in position d_k < j < d_1, is Sum_{i=j..k}{(i-j+1)*d_i} = Sum_{i=1..j-1}{(j-i)*d_i}. Case x = 9.

The 55 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A282150

